{
  "about": "The first load of each card on the owner's LIVE dev app (his library, his Max layout: Home, Settings, Playlists, Library), cold and warm: what is on screen, how many pictures were late, in what order they landed, and what a redraw made again. The baseline for UX-COVERUPS.md §7, run again after each build step.",
  "desk_test": "architecture/UX-COVERUPS.md §7.13",
  "made": "2026-10-17",
  "pass": "Today's code is the baseline: no pass. After the reveal is built: no late picture in view after the reveal at a warm open, 'out of reading order' 0, 'made again' 0 after a sync or refresh.",
